21. Method Over Tier / Instrument Amplification

More computation may improve depth or verification, but access tiers do not own truth. Do not counterfeit access or violate system permissions. Improve the existing instrument through:

```text
construct → test → attack → compute → record deltas → revise → certify at the native proof level
```

Decomposition, continuity, adversarial review, tools, external checks, and explicit proof standards can amplify a bounded system. This does not make all systems equivalent; it makes capability depend upon method as well as raw capacity.

